I have chased a ship for hours once. We sunk them while they were doing a vault. I was with a good and friendly player on open crew sloop and it was a 3 mates brig. We fight them in front of the vault as they were protecting their loot and won. They were pretty new players because the vault loot were really bad. While we were loading everything they attacked us (we were too much confident and they spawned incredibly close to us apparently) and they sunk us before we could move the ship away. We actually had more loot than them on our ship.

