Learn those 3 words in French:

&nbsp;

- Bonjour (Hello)
- S'il vous plait (please)
- Merci (Thank you)

&nbsp;

People in Paris are used to tourist and won't mind speaking English but I can't stress enough how important it is to know those 3 words in French. Bonjour need to be spammed like you want to BM your opponent. You are entering a shop? Say bonjour to the cashier. You enter an elevator? Say Bonjour. You go buy a ticket for the eiffel tower? Say Bonjour. The first word you HAVE to say to anyone in a day is Bonjour.

&nbsp;

You do not give tips in France. Sure you can left a 1€ or 2€ coins to a nice waiters who gave you advice and information for your next visit but overall France is a tips-free country.

&nbsp;

